WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.300
It takes only two people, not a crowd.

00:02.300 --> 00:04.605
You don't need a store, a company, or middlemen.

00:04.605 --> 00:09.205
It's as easy as posting something you no longer want,
or maybe posting a skill to help someone else.

00:09.205 --> 00:13.347
Invite anyone to trade at a site that is transparent,
safe, and frictionless.

00:13.347 --> 00:19.708
Unscrewed is open across the United States, with no listing fees,
no transaction fees, and no fake activity.

00:19.708 --> 00:23.980
Start your own barter circles at unscrewed dot L-O-L.
